  "description": "One-line JWT bearer authentication for ASP.NET Core with HMAC-SHA256 (HS256): configure in code or from appsettings, issue and validate tokens through an injectable IJwtTokenService or static helpers, with secure validation defaults for ASP.NET Core 3.1, 6, 8 and 10.",
  "id": "Fayakun.AspNetCore.Authentication.JwtBearer",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-09T11:25:20.85Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "bM3KRLvo9G2Pq+aB3Z6/zimbTxnQcM2hQNzTNCXzZmi/f4PhYzxo9SAuDWCIrO9gvI1B8Plx6Wrmp6R41/e90A==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 66632,
  "published": "2026-11-09T11:20:50.897Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 (breaking)\n- Targets the ASP.NET Core LTS releases: netcoreapp3.1, net6.0, net8.0 and net10.0 (net5.0, net7.0 and net9.0 dropped).\n- Security: pins patched Microsoft.IdentityModel versions (GHSA-59j7-ghrg-fj52) on every target.\n- Security: secrets must be at least 32 bytes (256 bits), as required for HS256. Only HS256 tokens are accepted (net6.0+).\n- Each token gets a unique \"jti\" claim.\n- New: AddJwtAuthentication(options => ...) and AddJwtAuthentication(configuration.GetSection(\"Jwt\")).\n- New: injectable IJwtTokenService registered by AddJwtAuthentication.\n- New: JwtTokenHelper.ValidateTokenAsync and CreateTokenValidationParameters.\n- Renamed TokenValidationResult to JwtValidationResult (it clashed with Microsoft.IdentityModel.Tokens), which adds IsExpired and Exception.\n- AddJwtAuthentication now lives in the Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection namespace.\n- JwtTokenHelper moved to the root namespace Fayakun.AspNetCore.Authentication.JwtBearer.\n- Default clock skew is 5 minutes. Keys use UTF-8 encoding (identical to v1 for ASCII secrets).",
